# Copy to .env and uncomment what you want to change.
# Loaded by the Makefile (-include .env) and exported into every make target,
# so `make run`, `make dev`, and `make test` all pick it up.
# Plain KEY=value lines only (no `export`, no quotes, no `~`). Built-in defaults
# are shown below; leaving everything commented changes nothing.

# Hugging Face token — only needed if the model isn't already in your HF cache.
# HF_TOKEN=hf_xxx

# LT_LOOKAHEAD=10.0
# LT_CHUNK=30.0
# LT_REMUX=1
# LT_TRANSLATE_MODEL=mlx-community/whisper-large-v3-mlx

# Absolute path, not ~ — the app does not expand the tilde.
# LT_CACHE=/Users/you/.cache/overhear-subs

# PORT=8000
